      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "team_0100_cassiopeia_04",
      "hash64": "BB40B6EA9F220A95",
      "text": "Leval ist also auch hier.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "team_0100_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "04929282C7D56C81",
      "text": "Na klaro, ist ja schließlich das letzte Versteck.\\nDas große Finale lass ich mir nicht entgehen![VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "team_0100_cassiopeia_05",
      "hash64": "BB40B5EA9F2208E2",
      "text": "Bei dir möchte ich mich auch noch für deine Hilfe\\nbedanken, Leval. Ich hoffe, du hast mir mein\\r\\nanfängliches Misstrauen dir gegenüber vergeben.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "team_0100_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "04929182C7D56ACE",
      "text": "Ach, kein Ding, Schwamm drüber.\\c\\nAber... Heißt das, Operation Stardust gibt’s nicht\\nmehr, wenn wir dieses Versteck abgehakt haben?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "team_0100_cassiopeia_06",
      "hash64": "BB40B4EA9F22072F",
      "text": "Nicht ganz. Es bleibt immer noch Big Boss,\\nder Drahtzieher von Team Star.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "team_0100_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "04929482C7D56FE7",
      "text": "Und den spüren wir wie auf?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "team_0100_cassiopeia_07",
      "hash64": "BB40B3EA9F22057C",
      "text": "Sobald alle Bosse zurückgetreten sind,\\nwird Big Boss sich schon zeigen.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "team_0100_nelke_05",
      "hash64": "04929382C7D56E34",
      "text": "Alles klar...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "team_0100_cassiopeia_08",
      "hash64": "BB40BAEA9F221161",
      "text": "Bald haben wir es geschafft. Ich verlasse mich\\nweiterhin auf euch.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "team_0100_nelke_06",
      "hash64": "04929682C7D5734D",
      "text": "Cassiopeia hat aufgelegt, oder...?\\nOkay.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "team_0100_nelke_07",
      "hash64": "04929582C7D5719A",
      "text": "Vielen Dank, dass du mir dabei geholfen hast,\\nTeam Star besser zu verstehen, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "team_0100_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "04928882C7D55B83",
      "text": "Ich weiß, was ich jetzt zu tun habe...\\nMeine Entscheidung steht fest.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "team_0100_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "04928782C7D559D0",
      "text": "Dafür bin ich dir sehr dankbar, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\nPass auf dich auf und... eskalier dadrinnen nicht\\r\\nzu sehr! Das sagt ihr jungen Leute doch so, oder?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
